WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:16.030
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:16.130 --> 00:01:25.620
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.300
Don't worry Master Kajika.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:37.340
- You will be able to go to the land of the Sun!
- Lee-Leng!

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:40.080
- Please forgive me!
- Lee-Leng!

00:01:48.430 --> 00:01:53.170
The Beginning of 1,000 Years

00:01:56.640 --> 00:01:58.940
Your Highness. Your Highness Rumaty.

00:01:59.960 --> 00:02:03.330
Your Highness, you may no longer enter the Palace without reason.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.700
- Please understand this.
- Why?!

00:02:08.180 --> 00:02:10.500
- It's because---
- Answer me!

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:14.200
Is it such a bad thing to go see my brother?!

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:18.020
A ruler is supposed to be in solitude.
 In order to lead the people...

00:02:18.210 --> 00:02:21.050
...he must learn how to withstand the isolation.

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:23.240
I don't know what you're saying!

00:02:25.630 --> 00:02:26.680
What is that?

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:33.340
It's popular in the streets. 
 You hit these together and compete for a higher score.

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:35.160
That's a beautiful thing.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:44.360
- If you look at it like this, it's prettier! Take a look at it Quinza! 
- Yes, sir.

00:02:47.130 --> 00:02:50.890
Isn't it great?! 
 I wanted to show this to my brother too.

00:03:04.780 --> 00:03:08.830
Glory be to my king!

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:14.310
We're approaching Raginei's airspace shortly. 
 Just to confirm with you...

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.040
...we're allowed to fire live rounds, correct?!

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.710
Yes, do it. 
 Once the target passes the final line...

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.220
...destroy this with all your might.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:33.450
- Kajika. 
- I'll be fine.

00:03:33.550 --> 00:03:35.900
You don't have to act so tough. 
 You might sprain your ankle.

00:03:37.650 --> 00:03:42.430
<i>There's something weird. 
 It's still the same Lee-Leng but...</i>

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:52.880
<i>...he suddenly seems like a different person.</i>

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:59.000
<i>It makes me blush.</i>

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:07.220
Is this Quinza's?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:13.490
- That means he's still alive! 
- Where is he?! He fell from there!

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:17.060
- He must be hurt badly! 
- We don't know that for sure.

00:04:17.700 --> 00:04:23.240
As long as he's alive he'll try to attack us. 
 I have to let Carl and the others know.

00:04:28.840 --> 00:04:31.900
Don't tell Rumaty about Quinza.

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:35.630
I still can't hate Quinza.

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:40.180
- If you say so. 
- Thanks!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:44.550
Master Kajika! 
 Master Lee-Leng!

00:04:44.610 --> 00:04:49.200
- Toranosuke! 
- I'm glad you're OK. What happened?!

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:52.800
- I'll tell you later. 
- Yes, sir! Please get in!

00:04:55.350 --> 00:05:00.890
- What's going on?! 
- His Highness Rumaty is going to give a speech at the airport!

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:02.390
Rumaty is?!

00:05:11.020 --> 00:05:16.660
- Is he really going to show up?! 
- You're right. It's too dangerous here.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:21.090
He'll come. 
 According to Army General Rezat...

00:05:21.560 --> 00:05:25.930
...the military accepted His Highness' intent and decided to stay at ease.

00:05:26.310 --> 00:05:28.570
But the military isn't monolithic.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:32.430
There's a chance that supporters of the current king may be here.

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:37.550
Even if that's the case, he'll still come out. 
 That's the kind of prince he is.

00:05:42.240 --> 00:05:45.100
We're on alert with the help of Lieutenant Noei...

00:05:45.280 --> 00:05:49.040
...but we don't have enough men.

00:05:50.020 --> 00:05:54.250
- There's still a chance of an attack.
 - Still, I have to speak.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:06:01.000
- There's something that I must tell the people, here! 
- Your Highness!

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:09.500
Rumaty?! 
 He has no business here!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:13.420
Wasn't he exiled?!

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:17.630
Even if that's the case---he'll be welcomed back as the king.

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:22.180
Why is that?! 
 Is this a sign from God?!

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:26.740
I told you. I don't have the ability to hear the voice of God anymore.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:32.410
It is obvious from the crowd gathered here.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:38.900
- Anything going on inside the palace? 
- There's nothing in particular.

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:41.960
Where are you going?!

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.470
Are you awake?!

00:06:52.440 --> 00:06:56.710
Don't move too much. 
 I've only lightly treated the wound.

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.360
Did I fail?

00:07:01.740 --> 00:07:04.170
I saw you go out in a disguise...

00:07:04.710 --> 00:07:08.370
...I knew I wasn't supposed to, but I followed you.

00:07:09.930 --> 00:07:15.350
We're almost at the hospital. 
 I called and told them to have a doctor see you immediately.

00:07:16.050 --> 00:07:17.770
- His Highness.
- What?

00:07:18.440 --> 00:07:23.600
His Highness Rumaty--- isn't it time for him to arrive at the airport?!

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:26.370
- Right! 
- Get the radio.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:32.800
<i>It's His Highness Rumaty! 
 His Highness Rumaty has just appeared!</i>

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:10.860
<i>Kajika!</i>

00:08:12.110 --> 00:08:15.430
I am Rumaty Ivan Di Raginei!

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:19.150
The rightful king of Raginei!

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:26.730
Rumaty!

00:08:27.750 --> 00:08:32.850
Two years ago I was exiled from this country on a bogus crime.

00:08:33.680 --> 00:08:37.630
But I did not return here to take revenge.

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:42.050
For Raginei to regain its glory.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:48.200
I've returned so that it'll regain the glory that it had during the reign of Machaty!

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:50.340
Your Highness!

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:55.150
Our current wealth is all gained from reaping the benefits of oil.

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:57.850
But that'll dry up in 30 years.

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:02.150
For Raginei's history to span another 1,000 years...

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:06.610
...for our children to live peacefully...

00:09:06.960 --> 00:09:09.100
...we must fight on!

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:13.560
There'll be no tomorrow if we all don't pay a price!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:17.700
Amazing! Everyone in the crowd of 100,000 is listening to him!

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.170
The palace is not exempt from this either.
 No...

00:09:21.520 --> 00:09:25.120
...the one to pay the biggest price is the Palace!

00:09:25.470 --> 00:09:30.630
There's no future for this country if the Palace holds power and wealth!

00:09:31.650 --> 00:09:37.610
That is why I will become the king! 
 I came back to save this country!

00:09:38.080 --> 00:09:41.490
To sit on the throne as the last king!

00:09:43.150 --> 00:09:43.880
No way!

00:09:49.460 --> 00:09:50.410
Your Highness!

00:09:54.620 --> 00:10:00.160
To never concentrate the power in the hands of a few...

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:06.240
...I will change Raginei from a constitutional monarchy into a republic!

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:12.010
In order to do that--- I'm here as the last king to lead Raginei!

00:10:12.610 --> 00:10:15.930
Along with you! 
 With all the people!

00:10:18.540 --> 00:10:22.140
The king himself has declared a restructuring to a republic?!

00:10:22.520 --> 00:10:24.430
What is he saying?!

00:10:25.360 --> 00:10:27.780
That's the way to do it!

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:32.590
Raginei does not belong to the Palace, but it belongs to you.

00:10:33.190 --> 00:10:39.150
In order to build another 1,000 glorious years along with you, I swear before you.

00:10:41.380 --> 00:10:43.580
Your Highness, you're not going to...

00:10:45.930 --> 00:10:49.980
I pray before God. 
 And I swear...

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:54.470
...that I will dedicate my life!

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:58.580
I will show you my utmost respect.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:05.750
To the people of Ragi and to my fellow citizens.

00:11:22.760 --> 00:11:25.690
I'm moving in!

00:11:28.010 --> 00:11:30.780
It's quite the crowd! 
 I can't hear anything!

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:33.750
It's as though they approved of him as the king.

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:35.750
Your Highness---

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:44.100
<i>The crowd is cheering wildly and no one is moving!</i>

00:11:44.350 --> 00:11:49.130
- His Highness Rumaty.
- Master Quinza, should we head to the airport?

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.360
No, it's alright.

00:11:52.990 --> 00:11:57.990
There's nothing more I need to do. 
 This is beyond my imagination.

00:11:58.880 --> 00:12:03.180
His Highness has grown up so much. Listen to the cheers.

00:12:04.550 --> 00:12:08.850
- Master Quinza! 
- To the Palace! Hurry!

00:12:10.510 --> 00:12:12.040
But, your wounds.

00:12:12.510 --> 00:12:15.410
I must greet His Highness.

00:12:15.860 --> 00:12:20.890
You can't with that wound!
 You have to get that wound treated!

00:12:21.810 --> 00:12:24.400
- Please.
- Master Quinza!

00:12:25.800 --> 00:12:28.150
It's my last wish!

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:40.320
<i>There's nothing for me to worry about. 
With His Highness Rumaty everything will be fine.</i>

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:44.970
<i>His Highness Machaty's "negative" assets won't be able to even come close.</i>

00:12:46.310 --> 00:12:48.320
<i>There is nothing more I can do...</i>

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:01.090
<i>...There's one more thing!</i>

00:13:01.860 --> 00:13:04.630
There's one more thing!

00:13:05.780 --> 00:13:10.740
Hanasakeru Seishonen

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:16.570
Your Highness! Your Highness!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:23.040
- It seems like the people approved. 
- Of course!

00:13:24.090 --> 00:13:27.820
That was quite the act! 
 You had me nervous for a second.

00:13:28.200 --> 00:13:33.650
I'm not quite done yet. 
 There are powers that are against the restructuring to a republic.

00:13:34.600 --> 00:13:39.920
- Are you going to fight?
- We're at your service! - We will fight along with you!

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:43.230
Wait a minute! 
 I'm here to reconcile!

00:13:44.190 --> 00:13:48.270
Let the Palace know, that I want to hold a reconciliation conference with my brother.

00:13:48.780 --> 00:13:50.080
Yes, sir. I'm on it!

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:52.600
- Rumaty! 
- Kajika!

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:58.330
- I'm glad you're alright! 
- You too!

00:13:59.380 --> 00:14:04.000
I heard your speech! 
 It was great! I had the shakes!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.280
It's from Lee-Leng teaching me.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:14.830
- What is it? 
<i>- That's right. Rumaty's my cousin!</i>

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:21.240
<i>But, this is a secret. 
 I'm always going to keep this a secret from Rumaty.</i>

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:24.260
Oh, it's nothing.

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.020
- Lee-Leng, this way! 
- Lee-Leng?

00:14:29.390 --> 00:14:33.630
It was quite the scene, Your Highness. 
 There's nothing that I have...

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:39.070
-...left to teach you.
- No, you're going to be my teacher forever.

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:41.910
I'm not going to let you go that easily.

00:14:49.110 --> 00:14:54.360
- Mustafa! 
- I heard from Toranosuke. You were tough.

00:14:55.960 --> 00:14:58.570
I was just rescued.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:02.840
Kajika.

00:15:05.580 --> 00:15:09.210
Kajika! 
 Noei is back from patrol.

00:15:09.690 --> 00:15:12.360
Really?! 
 I'll talk to you later.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.650
<i>It's done.</i>

00:15:28.130 --> 00:15:31.570
<i>I don't know what to do. 
 It's tougher than I had imagined.</i>

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:37.110
<i>I knew this was going to happen, to my feelings.</i>

00:15:37.940 --> 00:15:43.830
<i>I knew how sad I was going to be. 
I knew it all, but ---</i>

00:15:54.820 --> 00:15:57.400
This is good.

00:15:57.790 --> 00:16:01.350
- But, Master Quinza! 
- Stay away from me.

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:04.600
If you are near me, you'll be in danger too.

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:07.060
What do you mean?!

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:10.880
Don't let anyone know that you were in on it with me.

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:16.710
We have to designate you as the anti-king leader of the Palace.

00:16:16.930 --> 00:16:22.310
- No way! I will go with you Master Quinza! Even if--- 
- You may not!

00:16:26.710 --> 00:16:29.480
You must be the leader of the chamberlains.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:34.420
- And welcome His Highness Rumaty! 
- Master Quinza!

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:39.200
That is your duty from now on.

00:16:47.800 --> 00:16:51.330
It's really quiet. 
 Is no one here?

00:16:52.070 --> 00:16:54.550
To protect King Somand?

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:57.390
It's obvious.

00:16:58.500 --> 00:17:00.630
I planned it to be like this.

00:17:04.580 --> 00:17:07.230
Who is it? 
 Come out.

00:17:09.870 --> 00:17:12.960
Oh it's you, Your Highness Najayra.

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:15.700
I was waiting for you Quinza.

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:19.870
I'm sorry to make you wait.

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:23.820
You must be quite upset with me.

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:27.040
Yes. It's quite upsetting.

00:17:30.580 --> 00:17:32.230
I apologize.

00:17:35.290 --> 00:17:37.840
There's no one around.

00:17:38.990 --> 00:17:43.480
There's no need to act! 
It went as you planned!

00:17:44.340 --> 00:17:49.590
You brought Somand to ruins.
 And as his fiancé, I lose power too!

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:57.110
There's no one else that can become the king aside from Rumaty now!

00:17:57.650 --> 00:18:00.900
If I don't do anything, Rumaty will take the throne!

00:18:01.380 --> 00:18:04.920
There's nothing for you to hide!

00:18:07.180 --> 00:18:12.820
Raise your face! 
 Raise your face Quinza!

00:18:17.820 --> 00:18:19.310
Stop it.

00:18:20.680 --> 00:18:23.580
Tell me the truth. Just once!

00:18:24.120 --> 00:18:27.150
Just tell me that you never thought anything of me!

00:18:27.790 --> 00:18:32.720
Tell me it was all for Rumaty!
 Please!

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:38.300
Don't be foolish, Your Highness.

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:42.820
- Quinza. 
- For you to doubt my love for you.

00:18:43.710 --> 00:18:49.260
What was it about me that brought such a thought to your mind?

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:56.930
It's unfortunate that it had to turn out like this, but...

00:18:57.730 --> 00:19:02.410
...His Highness Rumaty will never mistreat the Chadli family.

00:19:03.180 --> 00:19:07.450
So, please cooperate with His Highness Rumaty to rebuild the nation.

00:19:09.200 --> 00:19:11.330
Why?

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.740
I am praying that you'll find happiness.

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:22.000
And to not fall in love with someone that gave their life to the country.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:26.750
- Quinza. 
- May you be safe.

00:19:48.220 --> 00:19:51.470
<i>I lost. 
 I've totally been defeated.</i>

00:19:56.980 --> 00:20:00.390
<i>A man that never even looked at me...</i>

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:04.460
<i>...is not worth killing.</i>

00:20:08.410 --> 00:20:11.980
<i>He never told me the truth.</i>

00:20:13.450 --> 00:20:17.430
<i>I just wanted him to tell me the truth just once!</i>

00:20:18.030 --> 00:20:19.820
<i>I just wanted to know the truth.</i>

00:20:22.110 --> 00:20:24.340
<i>No, I didn't want to hear it.</i>

00:20:25.300 --> 00:20:28.610
<i>I just wanted him to tell me, "I love you." even if it wasn't true!</i>

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:35.240
<i>I didn't want him to break the illusion that I had.</i>

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.200
<i>You knew it all this time...</i>

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:42.340
<i>...you knew all that...</i>

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:45.300
<i>That's why you never said it even to the end.</i>

00:20:50.270 --> 00:20:52.310
You'll be able to see it soon.

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:55.880
That's it! 
That's it!

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:00.880
Raginei Palace.

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.980
I have to hurry.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:20.630
- Who is that?! 
- It's me.

00:21:20.980 --> 00:21:25.660
- Your Highness.
- Don't come near! I'm scared!

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:33.850
Don't worry Your Highness. 
 There's someone here to protect you.

00:21:34.450 --> 00:21:39.200
Help?! 
 Is Quinza back?!

00:21:41.170 --> 00:21:44.490
No. But he's a very gentle person.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:47.580
- Gentle? 
- Yes.

00:21:48.090 --> 00:21:53.790
You have to listen to his commands.

00:21:55.830 --> 00:21:57.160
You're a good boy.

00:22:05.830 --> 00:22:09.360
Hurry and come Your Highness!

00:22:10.320 --> 00:22:12.140
I want to greet you properly.

00:22:15.900 --> 00:22:19.370
I want to see you come into this palace.

00:22:20.290 --> 00:22:22.200
With my own eyes!

00:22:37.520 --> 00:22:40.450
It's quite the scene when you see it up close.

00:22:47.240 --> 00:22:52.750
- Rumaty! 
- <i>I'm back. I'm finally back!</i>

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
